            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deeply niche arthouse game by a band you’ve probably never heard of, made for approximately twelve people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will make you suffer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reward for beating it is some file from the band. Just… a file. It changes from time to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not that it matters. You’re not beating this game anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far, nobody has even figured out how to walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/627460/extras/ea45f3f766c5fb2052df7a247e0fbbc1.poster.avif?t=1786040053\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/627460/extras/ea45f3f766c5fb2052df7a247e0fbbc1.webm?t=1786040053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/627460/extras/ea45f3f766c5fb2052df7a247e0fbbc1.mp4?t=1786040053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deeply niche arthouse game by a band you’ve probably never heard of, made for approximately twelve people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will make you suffer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your reward for beating it is some file from the band. Just… a file. It changes from time to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not that it matters. You’re not beating this game anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far, nobody has even figured out how to walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/627460/extras/ea45f3f766c5fb2052df7a247e0fbbc1.poster.avif?t=1786040053\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/627460/extras/ea45f3f766c5fb2052df7a247e0fbbc1.webm?t=1786040053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/627460/extras/ea45f3f766c5fb2052df7a247e0fbbc1.mp4?t=1786040053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
