                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[quote][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/9686972/]Follow our curator page \"[b]First Person Exploration and Puzzle Games[/b]\" for more games like this![/url][/quote]\nAnother pile of garbage that shouldn't be allowed on Steam.\n\nYou walk around a giant pointless maze with copied+pasted decay everywhere.  When you reach what appears to be the end of the maze, you're awarded with a staircase blocked off by rocks.  If there's anything more to this game, there's no indication of that in the game itself.\n\nThis game is apparently supposed to be a promotion for some band, but I don't even see where that comes from.  There was only one background track while I played, consisting of light piano music.\n\nAvoid this game at all costs.",
